<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-GREMIO AND FLAMENGO DRAW 0-0 IN COPA BRASIL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GREMIO AND FLAMENGO DRAW 0-0 IN COPA BRASIL.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gremio and Flamengo drew 0-0 in the first leg of the Copa Brasil final on Tuesday. The second leg will be played on Thursday.</p>
</text>
